Below is the one‐line change needed in `lighthouse‐core/audits/user‐timings.js` to filter out any userTiming entries whose name begins with `ad_` or `goog_`. By inserting an early `if (evt.name.startsWith(...)) return false;` you prevent all of the Google-ad injected marks/measures from ever reaching the rest of the logic.

```javascript
### lighthouse-core/audits/user-timings.js
